    "title": "White House says 'save your tears' to pop superstar who bashed Trump - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By David Cifarelli ,\n7 days ago The White House has responded to Ariana Grande after the star singer-actress ridiculed Donald Trump’s presidency directly to his supporters. The “Wicked” star recently condemned the Trump administration’s ICE raids across the U.S., transphobic rhetoric and brought up the current state of free speech in a recent message on her Instagram story. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
